<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="auth" id="contenido">
    <aside class="auth-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582139329536-e7284fece509?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=70"
           alt="" onerror="this.remove()">
      <a href="/" class="brand" tabindex="-1"><span class="brand-mark"><i class="material-icons">vpn_key</i></span>Custodia</a>
      <div class="auth-quote reveal">
        <h2>Tu información, tras una puerta de acero.</h2>
        <p>Tu contraseña se guarda cifrada con bcrypt: ni siquiera nosotros podemos leerla.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <section class="auth-panel">
      <div class="auth-card auth-card--wide reveal" style="--d: .1s">
        <span class="eyebrow"><i class="material-icons" aria-hidden="true">person_add</i>Nueva cuenta</span>
        <h1>Crea tu cuenta</h1>
        <p class="lead">Completa tus datos. Los campos con <span class="req">*</span> son obligatorios.</p>

        <form id="signup-form" autocomplete="on">
          <div class="alert alert--error" data-summary hidden role="alert"></div>

          <div class="form-grid">
            <%- include('partials/field', { field: {
              id: 'name', name: 'name', label: 'Nombre', icon: 'person_outline', required: true, counter: true,
              placeholder: 'Ana María', autocomplete: 'given-name', attrs: 'minlength="2" maxlength="50" data-rule="name" data-normalize="spaces" autofocus'
            } }) %>

            <%- include('partials/field', { field: {
              id: 'lastName', name: 'lastName', label: 'Apellido', icon: 'badge', required: true, counter: true,
              placeholder: 'Torres Quispe', autocomplete: 'family-name', attrs: 'minlength="2" maxlength="50" data-rule="lastName" data-normalize="spaces"'
            } }) %>

            <%- include('partials/field', { field: {
              id: 'phoneNumber', name: 'phoneNumber', label: 'Teléfono', type: 'tel', icon: 'phone', required: true,
              placeholder: '+51 987 654 321', autocomplete: 'tel', hint: 'Entre 7 y 15 dígitos',
              attrs: 'maxlength="22" inputmode="tel" data-rule="phoneNumber" data-filter="phone" data-normalize="spaces"'
            } }) %>

            <%- include('partials/field', { field: {
              id: 'birthdate', name: 'birthdate', label: 'Fecha de nacimiento', type: 'date', icon: 'cake', required: true,
              autocomplete: 'bday', attrs: 'data-rule="birthdate"'
            } }) %>

            <%- include('partials/field', { field: {
              id: 'email', name: 'email', label: 'Correo electrónico', type: 'email', icon: 'mail_outline', required: true, span2: true,
              placeholder: 'nombre@dominio.com', autocomplete: 'email', hint: 'Será tu usuario para iniciar sesión',
              attrs: 'maxlength="254" inputmode="email" data-rule="email" data-normalize="email" data-async="email"'
            } }) %>

            <%- include('partials/field', { field: {
              id: 'password', name: 'password', label: 'Contraseña', type: 'password', icon: 'lock_outline', required: true,
              placeholder: 'Crea una contraseña segura', autocomplete: 'new-password', toggle: true, caps: true, passwordBox: true, span2: true,
              attrs: 'minlength="8" maxlength="64" data-rule="password"'
            } }) %>

            <%- include('partials/field', { field: {
              id: 'confirmPassword', name: 'confirmPassword', label: 'Confirmar contraseña', type: 'password', icon: 'lock', required: true, span2: true,
              placeholder: 'Repite la contraseña', autocomplete: 'new-password', toggle: true,
              attrs: 'maxlength="64" data-rule="confirm" data-match="password"'
            } }) %>
          </div>

          <div class="field" data-field="terms">
            <label for="terms">
              <input type="checkbox" class="filled-in" id="terms" name="terms" required aria-describedby="terms-msg">
              <span><span class="label-text">Términos</span>: acepto que mis datos se usen solo para esta práctica de laboratorio.</span>
            </label>
            <p class="field-msg" id="terms-msg" aria-live="polite"></p>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="cbtn cbtn--block">
            <i class="material-icons" aria-hidden="true">how_to_reg</i>Crear mi cuenta
          </button>
        </form>

        <p class="auth-foot">¿Ya tienes cuenta? <a href="/signIn">Inicia sesión</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/scripts') %>
  <script type="module" src="/js/pages/signup.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
